+// included), copy_from_slot, slot_park_put and the main session's own resume loop.  The host model of a slot's cells
+// near the end illustrates why a mount from the slot's chain is the image's state; it builds both sides with the same
+// operations, so it shows the argument and proves nothing about the engine's copies (the GPU check does that:
+// tools/cache_reuse_check.py).
+#include "strata/core/conversation_cache.hpp"
+#include "strata/program/slot_chain.hpp"
+
